 "sentences": [
  "A famous ancient stone became mere building material.",
  "It features a decree issued in 196 BC.",
  "The text uses hieroglyphic, Demotic, and Ancient Greek.",
  "Minor differences between them made it key to deciphering the scripts.",
  "A French officer found it in July 1799 during France's invasion.",
  "It was the first Ancient Egyptian bilingual text recovered in modern times.",
  "Soon, copies and casts circulated among European museums and scholars."
